# The one .gitignore of this repository. There are no nested ones on purpose (frontend/, backend/,
# floorplan/ or .idea/): everything that git ignores is listed here, grouped by what creates it.
# A leading / anchors a rule to the repository root, **/ matches at any depth.

# ── Build output ──
# .NET compiler output
**/bin/
**/obj/
# Angular build output, cache and test coverage
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/coverage/
# The frontend build that is copied next to the backend for local runs (the Docker image does this itself)
backend/**/wwwroot/

# ── Dependencies ──
**/node_modules/

# ── Local configuration and secrets ──
# Real values (Debrid-Link key, archive passwords) live in .env; .env.example documents the names
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Case-sensitive on Linux, so *.local.json does not cover the capital L of this file
appsettings.Local.json
# Personal overrides of any tool, for example .impeccable/config.local.json
*.local.json

# ── Local runs and test data ──
# Finished media of a local run (in Docker the folder is mounted as /downloads)
/downloads/
# Local data that never belongs in the repository
/data/
# Link lists and scratch files for manual tests
/testing/

# ── IDEs ──
# JetBrains Rider and WebStorm, including the .gitignore files they write into .idea/ themselves
.idea/
# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user

# ── System files ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Tools that write into the repository ──
# Claude Code: settings and launch configuration of the local sessions
.claude/
# Claude Code: personal notes for this project (the Floorplan skill adds a block to it)
CLAUDE.local.md
# Floorplan: the generated map of the codebase; a build recreates floorplan/.gitignore, this rule is the one that counts
/floorplan/
# Impeccable: caches of the design hook (config.local.json is covered by *.local.json)
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/hook.pending.json
# Brag: the generated launch video with its poster, plan and Hyperframes project
/brag-output/
